<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR comes down to 13.03 from 13.07 pc.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR comes down to 13.03 from 13.07 pc.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month fell to 13.03 from 13.07 percent on Thursday and the bid rate (Athibid) eased to 12.54 from 12.58 percent.</p>
